{"video": "panetone", "titulo": "Por que o panetone só aparece no Natal?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "kokoro", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.0}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 100, "lines": [{"text": "Por que o panetone só aparece no Natal?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 78, "words": [{"text": "Por", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 8}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 8, "endFrame": 15}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 15, "endFrame": 18}, {"text": "panetone", "startFrame": 18, "endFrame": 35}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 35, "endFrame": 40}, {"text": "aparece", "startFrame": 40, "endFrame": 58}, {"text": "no", "startFrame": 58, "endFrame": 66}, {"text": "Natal?", "startFrame": 66, "endFrame": 78}]}]}, {"id": "origem", "startFrame": 100, "endFrame": 422, "lines": [{"text": "Ele nasceu em Milão, na Itália.", "startFrame": 123, "endFrame": 182, "words": [{"text": "Ele", "startFrame": 123, "endFrame": 129}, {"text": "nasceu", "startFrame": 129, "endFrame": 143}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 143, "endFrame": 152}, {"text": "Milão,", "startFrame": 152, "endFrame": 165}, {"text": "na", "startFrame": 167, "endFrame": 172}, {"text": "Itália.", "startFrame": 172, "endFrame": 182}]}, {"text": "Dizem que um ajudante chamado Toni o inventou numa ceia de Natal…", "startFrame": 193, "endFrame": 320, "words": [{"text": "Dizem", "startFrame": 193, "endFrame": 208}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 208, "endFrame": 211}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 211, "endFrame": 217}, {"text": "ajudante", "startFrame": 217, "endFrame": 236}, {"text": "chamado", "startFrame": 236, "endFrame": 248}, {"text": "Toni", "startFrame": 248, "endFrame": 257}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 257, "endFrame": 259}, {"text": "inventou", "startFrame": 265, "endFrame": 283}, {"text": "numa", "startFrame": 283, "endFrame": 293}, {"text": "ceia", "startFrame": 293, "endFrame": 303}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 303, "endFrame": 308}, {"text": "Natal…", "startFrame": 308, "endFrame": 320}]}, {"text": "mas, pros historiadores, é só lenda.", "startFrame": 331, "endFrame": 400, "words": [{"text": "mas,", "startFrame": 331, "endFrame": 339}, {"text": "pros", "startFrame": 339, "endFrame": 344}, {"text": "historiadores,", "startFrame": 344, "endFrame": 374}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 374, "endFrame": 378}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 378, "endFrame": 383}, {"text": "lenda.", "startFrame": 383, "endFrame": 400}]}]}, {"id": "luxo", "startFrame": 422, "endFrame": 738, "lines": [{"text": "A verdade é mais simples: manteiga, ovos, açúcar e frutas eram caríssimos.", "startFrame": 445, "endFrame": 596, "words": [{"text": "A", "startFrame": 445, "endFrame": 448}, {"text": "verdade", "startFrame": 448, "endFrame": 464}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 464, "endFrame": 469}, {"text": "mais", "startFrame": 469, "endFrame": 475}, {"text": "simples:", "startFrame": 475, "endFrame": 489}, {"text": "manteiga,", "startFrame": 497, "endFrame": 517}, {"text": "ovos,", "startFrame": 517, "endFrame": 526}, {"text": "açúcar", "startFrame": 526, "endFrame": 542}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 542, "endFrame": 547}, {"text": "frutas", "startFrame": 547, "endFrame": 560}, {"text": "eram", "startFrame": 560, "endFrame": 576}, {"text": "caríssimos.", "startFrame": 576, "endFrame": 596}]}, {"text": "Então esse pão rico era guardado pra maior festa do ano.", "startFrame": 608, "endFrame": 715, "words": [{"text": "Então", "startFrame": 608, "endFrame": 626}, {"text": "esse", "startFrame": 626, "endFrame": 634}, {"text": "pão", "startFrame": 634, "endFrame": 640}, {"text": "rico", "startFrame": 640, "endFrame": 647}, {"text": "era", "startFrame": 647, "endFrame": 654}, {"text": "guardado", "startFrame": 654, "endFrame": 673}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 673, "endFrame": 680}, {"text": "maior", "startFrame": 680, "endFrame": 690}, {"text": "festa", "startFrame": 690, "endFrame": 700}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 700, "endFrame": 708}, {"text": "ano.", "startFrame": 708, "endFrame": 715}]}]}, {"id": "trabalho", "startFrame": 738, "endFrame": 1009, "lines": [{"text": "E dá trabalho: a massa tradicional fermenta por mais de um dia,", "startFrame": 760, "endFrame": 888, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 760, "endFrame": 765}, {"text": "dá", "startFrame": 765, "endFrame": 772}, {"text": "trabalho:", "startFrame": 772, "endFrame": 791}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 797, "endFrame": 800}, {"text": "massa", "startFrame": 800, "endFrame": 809}, {"text": "tradicional", "startFrame": 809, "endFrame": 836}, {"text": "fermenta", "startFrame": 836, "endFrame": 857}, {"text": "por", "startFrame": 857, "endFrame": 862}, {"text": "mais", "startFrame": 862, "endFrame": 868}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 868, "endFrame": 873}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 873, "endFrame": 880}, {"text": "dia,", "startFrame": 880, "endFrame": 888}]}, {"text": "e ainda esfria de cabeça pra baixo, pra não murchar!", "startFrame": 892, "endFrame": 987, "words": [{"text": "e", "startFrame": 892, "endFrame": 895}, {"text": "ainda", "startFrame": 895, "endFrame": 905}, {"text": "esfria", "startFrame": 905, "endFrame": 919}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 919, "endFrame": 926}, {"text": "cabeça", "startFrame": 926, "endFrame": 936}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 936, "endFrame": 942}, {"text": "baixo,", "startFrame": 942, "endFrame": 955}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 958, "endFrame": 961}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 961, "endFrame": 971}, {"text": "murchar!", "startFrame": 971, "endFrame": 987}]}]}, {"id": "fabrica", "startFrame": 1009, "endFrame": 1303, "lines": [{"text": "Há uns cem anos, Angelo Motta deixou o panetone alto, como a gente conhece.", "startFrame": 1032, "endFrame": 1170, "words": [{"text": "Há", "startFrame": 1032, "endFrame": 1036}, {"text": "uns", "startFrame": 1036, "endFrame": 1040}, {"text": "cem", "startFrame": 1040, "endFrame": 1052}, {"text": "anos,", "startFrame": 1052, "endFrame": 1060}, {"text": "Angelo", "st